	(text "AIN3: general 0..3.3 V input, 1k + 100n low-pass, clamped. Terminal: 3V3 / AIN3 / GND."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 251.46 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "248137cb-c5f9-4bb6-9c29-02d5ad7a0ee5")
	)
	(text "AIN2: module input for amplifier boards (e.g. PH-4502C, ORP) on 5 V. Terminal +5V / SIG / GND.\nDivider 10k/20k (fitted by default) maps 0..5 V to 0..3.33 V; leave 20k off for 1:1 up to 3.3 V.\nWith 10u: about 2.4 Hz low-pass. Clamped to 0..3.3 V."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 205.74 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "2e561d45-5ead-48e8-9b99-278c11f0ccde")
	)
	(text "Input filter 10M / 6n8 styroflex (68 ms; with the electrode 100M..1G: 0.7..7 s) against pump 50 Hz,\nsecond filter 10k/10u after the buffer. Probe load: TLV9062 input only (0.5 pA typ) plus styroflex\nleakage - no ceramic cap or clamp on PH_BNC/PH_IN.\nLAYOUT: guard ring (both layers) around PH_BNC, 10M, styroflex lead and TLV9062 pin 3, on net PH_BUF;\nmilled slots around BNC centre pad; short node; flux washed off."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 143.51 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "705ee1d4-0a27-4025-bede-dea22b5d3dcb")
	)
	(text "On-board pH amplifier (like the PH-4502C with low-leakage input). Glass electrode on BNC centre,\nreference on BNC shell. Probe biased to PH_REF = 1.65 V (3V3 / 2, buffered), AIN0 reads\n1.65 V +/- 59 mV/pH; aquaPi's ScaleAux calibration removes offset and slope."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 90.17 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "adbdda7b-1d53-4987-9836-013b8c1c33b5")
	)
	(text "1M in the reference line: if the tank water ever gets a DC path to GND (grounded sensor), the current\nthrough the reference electrode stays below ~1.7 uA instead of mA. The reading then goes visibly wrong,\nthe probe survives. Normal operation: only pA flow, no measurable drop."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 195.58 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "c98dcdff-c0cf-43b6-a7e0-370e6bbd96d7")
	)
	(text "ADS1115 on 3.3 V (I2C levels match the Pi), address 0x48 (JP 1-2, default) or 0x49 (2-3).\nAll channels are read single-ended (aquaPi driver): AIN0 on-board pH, AIN1 pH bias (monitor, allows\nAIN0-AIN1 differential later), AIN2 module input (0..5 V via divider), AIN3 general 0..3.3 V."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 30.48 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "d8ebef51-48ba-4f7d-9406-dd78662e5a74")
	)
